{"completed": true, "response": "<WritingBlock id=\"58321\" variant=\"standard\">脚步忽然轻快起来，明亮中透出一点俏皮，仿佛原本从容的交谈，转眼变成了你追我赶。每一句都急着接住上一句，笑意尚在，催促却已悄悄逼近。声音一层层向高处涌去，细密的起伏像不断叠起的浪，越翻越急，越亮越难以收住。那份欢欣渐渐带上近乎灼热的渴望，听得人也不由自主屏住呼吸，仿佛下一瞬就要彻底倾泻。可就在情绪几乎冲到顶端时，声音反而轻轻散开，像水光被风揉碎，漂浮在高处，迟迟找不到落脚的地方。方才的热度并未真正消退，只是失去了明确的去向，留下明亮而悬空的颤动，久久不能安定。</WritingBlock>", "metadata": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "headless": true, "provider_interface": true, "no_auto_retry": true, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\yi-cookie-repair-20261006\\job-90fefba81a82482d80f24aa36329e52a", "response_sha256": "be145522df7f5f5b4c49e8c1409a0a1cd5159171581e7b039fbba46ee5496b55", "session_handle": "7d03283f-54e9-4a85-8fa4-1821742a9195", "attachments": [], "prompt_normalization": "single_leading_BOM_removed_CRLF_or_CR_to_LF_and_trim_end", "pre_submit_scope": null, "initialization": {"source": "native_pre_send_aborted_handoff", "browser_assisted_initialization": true, "native_browser_generation_sent": false, "http_version": "auto", "nonpersonalization_inherited": false, "handoff_age_seconds": 1.026, "state": "claimed"}, "headless_initializer": {"headless": true, "native_browser_generation_sent": false, "completed": true, "browser_version": {"type": "string", "length": 13, "sha256": "9722c94be680575b307b26183e1a423460d4568949ad7f3e7f985d33d9bf0e26"}, "sealed_handoff_written": true, "browser_closed": true, "cloned_private_profile_removed": true, "elapsed_seconds": 6.735}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "continuation_expected": false, "handoff_seen": false, "lifecycle_updates": 101, "first_assistant_seconds": 29.266, "first_text_seconds": 29.438, "stream_seconds": 36.25, "channel_update_counts": {"final": 93}, "bounded_server_observations": {"scope": "http_sse", "tool_message_observation_count": 0, "truncated": false, "scalar_patch_tool_role_inheritance": false, "message_finished_successfully_is_tool_success": false, "tool_result_observations":